                                <num style="-uslm-dtd:enum" value="c">“(c) </num><heading style="-uslm-dtd:header">Conforming Provision for Redesignation of Applicable Section.—</heading><content style="-uslm-dtd:text">Any amounts authorized under this section for grants or project management oversight under section 24408 of such title shall be deemed to refer to grants or project management oversight under section 22908 of such title on or after the date of enactment of the Department of Transportation Reports Harmonization Act.”</content>
                            </subsection></quotedContent>;</content>
